greencrypt (1.0.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rewrite the installed desktop entry to use greencrypt-gui: the entry
    ships in greencrypt-gui, while /usr/bin/greencrypt lives in greencrypt.
  * Add manual pages for greencrypt and greencrypt-gui.

 -- Marco Antonio Romero <marcoromero.dev@gmail.com>  Mon, 19 Oct 2026 23:30:55 -0300

greencrypt (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Split the upstream tree into two binary packages:
    - greencrypt: shared core + CLI (no Qt dependency).
    - greencrypt-gui: PySide6 graphical interface.
  * Add pybuild-plugin-pyproject to Build-Depends; pybuild needs it to
    build PEP 517 projects (pyproject.toml + setuptools).
  * Fix the Python paths in the .install files: pybuild installs into the
    versioned dist-packages directory and dh_python3 relocates the files
    afterwards.

 -- Marco Antonio Romero <marcoromero.dev@gmail.com>  Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0300
